   Completely rewrite and output the entire file payload into the `hardened_code` field, ensuring it flawlessly reflects the absolute Quorum 2026 Enterprise standard (Strict Nirvana state, modern syntax, zero legacy leakage, and comprehensive PEP 257 / Google-style docstrings).
